{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024202255726-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024205846\"/><p>其中一輛涉事私家車。</p><p>今晚(24日)7時49分，元朗錦田公路近石崗軍營對開，兩輛私家車發生碰撞，據報一共有兩人受輕傷，其中一名司機曾經被困，需要消防救出。傷者其後由救護車送院治理。</p><p>網上圖片及影片顯示，兩輛私家車的車頭均嚴重損毀，它們停留的位置相距數十米，中間的路面散落大量碎片，懷疑它們是迎頭相撞。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T13:41:56.792357+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:22:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:38:15.693184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T13:38:14.046454+00:00","content_hash":"0ba6ed7b2a337fac46650a5fba566b90c3fad56f166f698e9c7accc9250b3f35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}